  m_text: 'There are two different control schemes available for our game, Stabilized
    and Acrobatic modes.


    In the stabilized mode, the drone will auto-level
    itself after the user is done with their inputs, leading to a much more pleasant
    and easier experience.


    In the acrobatic mode, the control of the drone
    is completely the users responsibility, leading to a harder, but more fun experience.


    To
    try them both out, you can ping the red cube below to switch control schemes
    to determine which one you would like more.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8b2647a34d1bcd419501bc680bbfc76, type: 2}
