  m_text: 'This place will act as your quick-start guide and tutorial on learning
    how to control your very own drone!


    To get started, arm your drone and
    push the left stick up to engage your propellers. This left stick will act as
    a way to control both your THRUST and your YAW.


    Using your right thumbstick,
    you can also adjust your ROLL and PITCH axis as well.


    If you are not knowledgable
    about what PITCH, ROLL and YAW are, please refer to the schematic on the right
    of this text.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8b2647a34d1bcd419501bc680bbfc76, type: 2}
